{
  "title": "Strut",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A drum instrument:",
        "sixteen pads, each",
        "its own drum.",
        "",
        "Each drum is built",
        "from three engines:",
        "Skin, a resonating",
        "body; Wave, an",
        "oscillator; and",
        "Noise, noise or a",
        "sample.",
        "",
        "Six pages, the same",
        "for every pad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Getting started",
      "lines": [
        "Put Strut in a synth",
        "slot and hit a pad.",
        "The pages now edit",
        "that pad.",
        "",
        "Turn Pad > SOUND for",
        "a starting sound, or",
        "Finish > DICE right",
        "for a new one.",
        "",
        "Kit > KIT picks a",
        "whole kit; Kit >",
        "DICE rolls one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Pad: the mix of the",
        "three engines, and",
        "the moves for all of",
        "them.",
        "",
        "Skin, Wave, Noise:",
        "one engine each,",
        "with a MOD switch",
        "for its modulator.",
        "",
        "Finish: the pad's",
        "level, pan and",
        "effects.",
        "",
        "Kit: the room and",
        "the whole kit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pad",
      "lines": [
        "SOUND: a starting",
        "sound. Own is the",
        "pad as it is.",
        "",
        "TUNE, DECAY: all",
        "three engines' pitch",
        "and length together.",
        "",
        "COLOR: darker left,",
        "thinner right.",
        "",
        "SKIN, WAVE, NOISE:",
        "each engine's level.",
        "",
        "SPACE: this pad's",
        "send to the room."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Skin",
      "lines": [
        "A body that rings,",
        "like a drum head or",
        "a bar.",
        "",
        "PITCH and RING: its",
        "note and how long it",
        "rings.",
        "",
        "HIT: what strikes",
        "it. Click, Soft,",
        "Burst, or the Wave",
        "or Noise engine.",
        "",
        "SNAP: how long the",
        "strike lasts.",
        "",
        "METAL: harder,",
        "clangy overtones.",
        "TONE: brightness.",
        "MODE: Low, Band or",
        "High."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wave",
      "lines": [
        "An oscillator.",
        "PITCH, and BEND: a",
        "drop or rise at the",
        "start of each hit.",
        "",
        "DECAY: how long it",
        "sounds.",
        "",
        "TABLE and WAVE: its",
        "shape. FM: Skin",
        "bends its pitch.",
        "RING: ring",
        "modulation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Noise",
      "lines": [
        "Noise, or a sample.",
        "TABLE lists the",
        "noises, then the",
        "sample library, then",
        "your own samples.",
        "",
        "COLOR: darker left,",
        "thinner right.",
        "DECAY: how long it",
        "falls.",
        "",
        "With a sample, MODE",
        "plays it straight",
        "(Sample), rebuilt",
        "(Resynth) or as its",
        "colour alone",
        "(Noise). START and",
        "LOOP set where it",
        "plays."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod",
      "lines": [
        "Turn MOD on an",
        "engine page to Mod",
        "for its modulator,",
        "and back to Sound.",
        "",
        "KIND: Envelope, LFO,",
        "Random or Velocity.",
        "RATE: free left,",
        "synced right.",
        "",
        "CURVE: the engine's",
        "envelope shape.",
        "",
        "Each AIM sends it to",
        "a knob of that",
        "engine, or Level, by",
        "its DEPTH.",
        "",
        "Knobs show what you",
        "set, not the",
        "movement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Finish",
      "lines": [
        "LEVEL and PAN.",
        "",
        "FLAM: one hit",
        "becomes three,",
        "further apart as it",
        "turns. For claps.",
        "",
        "DRIVE: saturation.",
        "CRUSH: fewer bits",
        "and a lower rate.",
        "",
        "LOW and HIGH:",
        "shelves, cut or",
        "boost.",
        "",
        "DICE: a new sound",
        "for this pad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Kit",
      "lines": [
        "SIZE: the room, from",
        "small to about four",
        "seconds. Each pad",
        "sends to it with Pad",
        "> SPACE.",
        "",
        "GLUE: compresses the",
        "kit. WARM: saturates",
        "it. VOL: its volume.",
        "",
        "CHOKE: this pad's",
        "group. Pads in a",
        "group cut each other",
        "off, like open and",
        "closed hats.",
        "",
        "KIT: a factory kit,",
        "loaded when you let",
        "go. Own is the kit",
        "as it is.",
        "",
        "PAD: the pad the",
        "pages edit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Dice",
      "lines": [
        "Turn DICE right for",
        "a new sound, left to",
        "go back. Eight steps",
        "back.",
        "",
        "Finish > DICE rolls",
        "this pad; Kit > DICE",
        "rolls all sixteen,",
        "each by its place:",
        "kicks on 1 and 5,",
        "snare 2, hats 3 and",
        "4, and so on.",
        "",
        "Rolls are level-",
        "matched and never",
        "silent.",
        "",
        "A SOUND or KIT pick",
        "is one step: DICE",
        "left undoes it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Saving",
      "lines": [
        "Your kit is saved",
        "with the set, and",
        "with My Presets on",
        "the slot.",
        "",
        "Loading brings back",
        "the pads as you left",
        "them."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
